  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SQLServerDBOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to Microsoft SQL Server — the industry-leading enterprise relational database. Stores OASIS holons and avatars using ADO.NET with indexed lookup columns and full JSON serialisation. Compatible with SQL Server 2016+ and Azure SQL. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Include context-independent SQL Server graph reads (c826060)\n- Include SQL Server depth validation and synchronous graph evidence (1487a75)\n- Include SQL Server graph connection-pool fix (deec267)\n- Include verified SQL Server graph hydration (2241ce4)\n- Integrate verified SQL Server avatar wallet persistence (87c6840)\n- Integrate verified SQL Server provider improvements (f3799c4)\n- Preserve flat SQL Server exports in Development batch (654de7f)\n- Recover Redis and SQL Server CQL launchers with canonical key dependency (7639a82)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SQLServerDBOASIS",
